1 0 0 1 74.00 585.00 Tm
(When Marcus decided to grow tomatoes on his balcony, his first instinct was to do it "properly" -) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 569.50 Tm
(so he bought a bottle of weed killer and a bag of chemical-boosted potting mix, just like the ads) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 554.00 Tm
(showed. Then, one evening, he actually read the back of the weed-killer bottle: a long list of) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 538.50 Tm
(warnings he couldn't pronounce, right next to a photo of the juicy tomatoes he planned to eat. He) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 523.00 Tm
(put the bottle down. "If I wouldn't drink it," he thought, "why would I feed it to something I'm going) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 507.50 Tm
(to eat?" He returned both products the next day, and grew his first tomatoes with nothing but) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 492.00 Tm
(compost and water. They were, he swears to this day, the best tomatoes he's ever tasted.) Tj
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 461.50 Tm
(Before we buy a single seed, it's worth understanding what "organic" really means and why it's worth) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 445.00 Tm
(your while - especially in a small space where every plant is close enough to touch, smell, and eat) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 428.50 Tm
(straight off the vine.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 406.00 Tm
(Organic gardening simply means growing without synthetic chemicals - no chemically manufactured) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 389.50 Tm
(fertilizers, weed killers, or pesticides. Instead of reaching for a spray bottle every time a bug or weed) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 373.00 Tm
(appears, you work with nature: feeding the soil, encouraging good bugs, and handling problems by) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 356.50 Tm
(hand or with simple homemade remedies.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 334.00 Tm
(Why does it matter? A few honest reasons:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 312.50 Tm
(- You control exactly what goes into your food. Store-bought sprays and fertilizers often carry) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 297.00 Tm
(    chemicals with real side effects. When you grow organically, there's no mystery - you know) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 281.50 Tm
(    precisely what did and didn't touch your dinner.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 266.00 Tm
(- It saves money. No monthly spending on fertilizers, pesticides, and weed killers \(and no) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 250.50 Tm
(    last-minute trips to buy more when you run out\). Compost from your kitchen scraps is free.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 235.00 Tm
(- It's healthier. Diets rich in fresh vegetables are linked to more energy and better long-term) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 219.50 Tm
(    health, and having your own supply a few steps from the kitchen makes eating well effortless.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 204.00 Tm
(- It simply tastes better. Ask anyone who's done it: an organic tomato tastes of tomato, not of the) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 188.50 Tm
(    chemicals used to protect it. For many growers, flavor alone is reason enough.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 166.00 Tm
(You don't have to be perfect or purist about it. Every chemical you don't use is a win for your body,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 149.50 Tm
(your budget, and your taste buds.) Tj
