/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 670.50 Tm
(2. Soil. This is the most important ingredient in the whole book. Your plants are only as healthy as) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 654.00 Tm
(their soil. It must be rich and fertile - and, crucially, free of synthetic chemical fertilizer. When buying,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 637.50 Tm
(choose bagged organic potting soil \(garden shops sell chemical-free mixes\). If a neighbor or family) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 621.00 Tm
(member has a yard, a few shovels of good garden soil can help too. A bonus of containers: your soil) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 604.50 Tm
(warms up faster and isn't chilled by cold ground.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 582.00 Tm
