/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 565.50 Tm
(need to thrive. You can buy bagged organic compost \(easiest for small spaces\), or make your own) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 549.00 Tm
(from scraps you'd otherwise throw away:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
