(The No-Chemical Rule. This is the heart of organic growing, so we'll say it plainly: do not use) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 654.00 Tm
(synthetic chemical fertilizers, weed killers, or pesticides - ever, in this garden. The temptation is real,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 637.50 Tm
(especially when soil looks poor or a bug appears. Resist it. Everything those products promise, you) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 621.00 Tm
(can achieve with compost, mulch, good habits, and simple homemade sprays \(coming in Chapter 8\).) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 604.50 Tm
(Feeding the soil beats drugging the plant, every time.) Tj
