0.720 0.470 0.100 rg
/F2 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 203.50 Tm
(The Two Waterers) Tj
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 188.00 Tm
(The Okafor family was thrilled with their balcony garden - so thrilled that both Dad and their) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 172.50 Tm
(daughter Ada watered it every morning, neither knowing the other had. Within two weeks the) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 157.00 Tm
(herbs yellowed and drooped, roots quietly drowning in permanently soggy soil. They'd assumed) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 141.50 Tm
(more care meant better care. The fix was almost funny: a little chart taped to the door where) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 126.00 Tm
(whoever watered ticked the box. One tick a day, one waterer a day. The plants perked up within) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 110.50 Tm
(the week. The lesson stuck - in a garden, rhythm and communication matter as much as effort.) Tj
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 80.00 Tm
(Planting is the exciting part; tending is where gardens are actually won. The daily rhythm is simple,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 63.50 Tm
(and it's mostly about water and weeds.) Tj
ET
