/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 709.50 Tm
(Watering - consistency is everything.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 688.00 Tm
(- Water early in the morning \(before ~10 a.m.\). Midday sun evaporates water before roots can) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 672.50 Tm
(    drink it.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 657.00 Tm
(- Don't overwater. This is the #1 killer, especially in homes with more than one eager waterer.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 641.50 Tm
(    Soggy soil drowns roots just as surely as drought starves them. After heavy rain, skip a day and) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 626.00 Tm
(    check first.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 610.50 Tm
(- Coordinate. If more than one person waters, use a shared schedule or a tick-chart so no pot gets) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 595.00 Tm
(    watered twice. Aim for the same time, the same amount, every day.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 579.50 Tm
(- Check the mulch when you water - if it's matted, loosen it so water can reach the soil.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 557.00 Tm
(The goal: soil that stays lightly damp, never bone-dry, never swampy.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 534.50 Tm
(Weeding - small and daily beats big and desperate. Weeds steal water and nutrients and can) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 518.00 Tm
(overrun a pot fast. Since you're organic, there's no spray - you rely on the good old-fashioned) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 501.50 Tm
(method: pull them by hand, a little every day. Wearing gloves, check your pots daily and pull weeds) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 485.00 Tm
(the moment you spot them, before they take hold. A couple of minutes a day prevents an) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 468.50 Tm
(overwhelming mess later. \(Toss weeds in the trash, not your compost - you don't want to replant their) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 452.00 Tm
(seeds.\)) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 429.50 Tm
(Feeding. Every few weeks, top up with a little compost around your plants to keep the soil rich -) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 413.00 Tm
(some hungry crops \(like tomatoes\) especially appreciate it.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 390.50 Tm
(Build these into a small daily loop - a two-minute morning visit with your coffee - and your garden will) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 374.00 Tm
(quietly thrive.) Tj
0.720 0.470 0.100 rg
