0.180 0.490 0.200 rg
/F2 17.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 376.50 Tm
(Chapter 8: Pests and Problems, the Organic Way) Tj
0.720 0.470 0.100 rg
/F2 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 342.00 Tm
(The Beer in a Saucer) Tj
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 326.50 Tm
(Something was eating Maria's lettuce overnight - ragged holes every morning, but never a culprit) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 311.00 Tm
(in sight. A neighbor grinned knowingly: "Slugs. Put out a little dish of beer." It sounded absurd, but) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 295.50 Tm
(Maria sank a shallow saucer of cheap beer into the soil that evening. The next morning it had) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 280.00 Tm
(done its quiet work, and her lettuce went untouched from then on. She'd been ready to give up on) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 264.50 Tm
(greens entirely. Instead she learned the organic gardener's real secret: for almost every pest,) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 249.00 Tm
(there's a simple, chemical-free trick - you just have to know it.) Tj
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 218.50 Tm
(Every garden gets visitors and ailments. Organic growing doesn't mean no pests - it means handling) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 202.00 Tm
(them without synthetic chemicals, using hands, barriers, good bugs, and simple homemade) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 185.50 Tm
(remedies. Here's your field guide.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 163.00 Tm
(Your all-purpose homemade spray. Mix two teaspoons of dish soap into one cup of vegetable oil;) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 146.50 Tm
(add a couple of teaspoons of that mix to a spray bottle of water. Spray the worst-hit spots. Plain) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 130.00 Tm
(diluted soapy water alone also works on many soft insects.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 107.50 Tm
(Common pests and organic fixes:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 86.00 Tm
(- Aphids - spray with diluted soapy water; prune and bin badly infested leaves.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 70.50 Tm
(- Slugs & snails - ring pots with copper tape, or sink a shallow saucer of beer nearby to trap them;) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
