1 0 0 1 76.00 679.50 Tm
(    job!\) or spray young ones with the soapy mix.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 664.00 Tm
(- Cutworms - pick them off after dark, when they feed.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 648.50 Tm
