1 0 0 1 76.00 617.50 Tm
(- Squash bugs - hide under leaves; check undersides and pick them off; spray if needed.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 595.00 Tm
(When bugs persist: plant more onion, garlic, and basil borders - pungent plants are powerful, free) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 578.50 Tm
(repellents, often better than spray.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 556.00 Tm
(Diseases - prevention beats cure. Watch for wilting, spots, blotches, rot, rust, or powdery/moldy) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 539.50 Tm
(coatings. To avoid disease: give plants good air circulation \(don't crowd\), water in the morning so) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 523.00 Tm
(leaves dry by night, rotate crops each year, keep the area clean, and choose disease-resistant seeds) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 506.50 Tm
(when offered. A few common ones:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 485.00 Tm
(- Bacterial leaf spot / late blight - remove and bin infected leaves promptly; morning watering helps) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 469.50 Tm
(    prevent it.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 454.00 Tm
(- Powdery mildew - spray with a little baking soda in water; prune for airflow; clear fallen leaves.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 438.50 Tm
(- Common rust / mosaic virus / wilts / clubroot - remove badly infected plants, control the insects) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 423.00 Tm
(    that spread disease, rotate crops, and pick resistant varieties.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 400.50 Tm
(Most problems are small if you catch them early - which is exactly why the daily two-minute loop from) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 384.00 Tm
(Chapter 7 matters so much.) Tj
