/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 709.50 Tm
("green thumb" you didn't have. Look at you now.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 687.00 Tm
(You learned to read your light and work with the space you actually have. You built a tiny farm from) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 670.50 Tm
(reused pots, free compost, and gathered mulch. You planted your first seeds - maybe with a) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 654.00 Tm
(toilet-paper seed tape and shaking hands - and you kept them alive through a daily two-minute loop) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 637.50 Tm
(of water and weeds. You met your first aphid and your first slug and you won, without a single) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 621.00 Tm
(synthetic chemical. And then, one ordinary morning, you picked something you grew, rinsed it, and) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 604.50 Tm
(tasted food the way it's supposed to taste.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 582.00 Tm
(That's not a small thing. In a few pots on a balcony, you took back a little control over what you eat,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 565.50 Tm
(saved some money, ate healthier, and discovered flavor that no store can sell you. You may have) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 549.00 Tm
(taught a child where food comes from. You may have turned a surplus into a gift that made a) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 532.50 Tm
(neighbor smile.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 510.00 Tm
(Here's the secret nobody tells beginners: the garden was never really about the vegetables. It was) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 493.50 Tm
(about the small daily attention, the patience, the quiet satisfaction of tending something and watching) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 477.00 Tm
(it grow. Those habits don't stop at the end of the season - they carry into a second pot, a bigger) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 460.50 Tm
(harvest, a windowsill in winter, a life lived a little closer to the things that feed us.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 438.00 Tm
(You started with one pot. See where it takes you next.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 415.50 Tm
(With soil under your nails and every good wish for your harvest,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 393.00 Tm
(Daniel Tesfamariam) Tj
0.400 0.400 0.400 rg
/F1 12.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 222.55 369.00 Tm
(dannyshalomnebiy@gmail.com) Tj
